    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can increase your powers of perception. As a Bonus Action, choose one of the following benefits, which lasts until you start a Short or Long Rest. You can't use this feature again until you finish a Short or Long Rest.</p><p><strong>Darkvision.</strong> You gain Darkvision with a range of 120 feet.</p><p><strong>Greater Comprehension.</strong> You can read any language.</p><p><strong>See Invisibility.</strong> You can cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplSeeInvisib]{See Invisibility} without expending a spell slot.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-yMCifjNVprBIOvCw\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Apply only the chosen benefit. Cast See Invisibility from this feature only while that benefit lasts.</p></section>",
